Package: anonyx
Architecture: all
Depends: tor, curl, nftables, iptables, iproute2, proxychains4 | proxychains, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: obfs4proxy, snowflake-client, macchanger, bash-completion, apparmor, tpm2-tools
Suggests: network-manager, gpio
Description: fail-closed Tor killswitch for Debian
 nftables primary with iptables fallback, optional Tor netns isolation,
 eBPF/XDP guard with nft fallback, corridor-style exit verification,
 append-only audit log, state.json restore without reboot.
 Rust dispatcher (memory-safe hot path) with bash fallback.

Package: anonyx-initramfs
Architecture: all
Depends: initramfs-tools, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: tpm2-tools
Description: early-boot network block for anonyx (paranoid)
 initramfs hook + init-premount script. Blocks all egress except
 loopback until the userspace anonyx daemon confirms Tor bootstrap.
 Optional package for paranoid installs.

Package: libanonyx-dev
Architecture: all
Section: libdevel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: anonyx eBPF object + nft templates for developers
 Ships lib/bpf/anonyx_kern.c and rule templates for audit.
